<title>POLAND: Novita sets conversion price at PLN 20.3.</title>
<headline>Novita sets conversion price at PLN 20.3.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish carpet maker Novita SA said on Friday it set the conversion price for its convertible bonds at 20.3 zlotys.</p>
<p>Novita also said it offered 227 bonds to selected investors, but did not give details. It closed at 17.3 zlotys on Friday.</p>
<p>It earlier said it wanted to issue up to 300 40-month convertible bonds through a private placement and up to 1,116,000 shares to be exchanged for the bonds.</p>
<p>It said the bonds, carried a nine-percent annual coupon.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
